{"PageNumber":441,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":13,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱضۡرِبۡ لَهُم مَّثَلًا أَصۡحَٰبَ ٱلۡقَرۡيَةِ إِذۡ جَآءَهَا ٱلۡمُرۡسَلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ضْرِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed> لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّثَلاً أَصْحَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْقَرْيَةِ إِذْ ج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُرْسَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٣</span>","End":"١٣","PageNumber":441,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":382,"MaqraNumber":176,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":14,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِذۡ أَرۡسَلۡنَآ إِلَيۡهِمُ ٱثۡنَيۡنِ فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا فَعَزَّزۡنَا بِثَالِثٖ فَقَالُوٓاْ إِنَّآ إِلَيۡكُم مُّرۡسَلُونَ","TajweedText":"إِذْ أَرْسَلْن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَيْهِمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ثْنَيْنِ فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا فَعَزَّزْنَا بِثَالِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ثٍ ف</tajweed>َقَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَيْك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّرْسَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٤</span>","End":"١٤","PageNumber":441,"JuzNumber":22,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":382,"MaqraNumber":176,"HizbNumber":44,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ مَآ أَنتُمۡ إِلَّا بَشَرٞ مِّثۡلُنَا وَمَآ أَنزَلَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ مِن شَيۡءٍ إِنۡ أَنتُمۡ إِلَّا تَكۡذِبُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> م<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ik